WEBVTT

01:38.240 --> 01:40.620
The reason that Fujikido, the NINJA Slayer,

01:40.620 --> 01:44.700
visited the progressive revolutionaries IKKI UCHIKOWASHI,

01:44.700 --> 01:49.040
was Yukano, the daughter of his
deceased master, Dragon-SENSEI.

01:50.130 --> 01:51.420
Begin.

01:51.420 --> 01:53.380
YEEART!

01:55.670 --> 01:59.060
Dark NINJA's attack had separated them,

01:59.060 --> 02:01.390
but how had Yukano lost her memories?

02:01.390 --> 02:06.350
Why did she call herself AMNESIA and act as an IKKI UCHIKOWASHI battle agent?

02:06.350 --> 02:08.230
HUWARRGH!

02:10.270 --> 02:12.150
AI...YEGGH...

02:13.270 --> 02:15.820
Everyone, NINJA Slayer-SAN is now

02:15.820 --> 02:21.280
an agent of our revolutionary group.

02:21.280 --> 02:24.660
Accepted! Revolution! Revolution!

02:24.950 --> 02:27.830
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

02:27.830 --> 02:30.540
I am ANSWERER.

02:27.830 --> 02:30.540
NOTE: An ANSWERER is ONE WHO ANSWERS.

02:30.540 --> 02:33.090
Welcome to IKKI UCHIKOWASHI.

02:33.670 --> 02:34.750
DŌMO.

02:34.750 --> 02:37.840
His SENSEI entrusted Yukano to him.

02:37.840 --> 02:42.930
He must see what type of organization she now belongs to with his own eyes.

02:47.930 --> 02:50.440
How is AMNESIA-SAN?

02:50.440 --> 02:53.270
She is a splendid warrior.

02:53.270 --> 02:57.150
What kind of man is your leader,
BUSTER Tetsuo?

02:57.150 --> 02:59.200
A great man.

02:59.200 --> 03:00.660
Is he a NINJA?

03:00.660 --> 03:03.070
You'll see for yourself at some point.

03:03.070 --> 03:07.750
That said, your combat performance has truly been a thing to behold.

03:07.750 --> 03:14.420
Your presence alone makes our organization twice as progressive!

03:14.710 --> 03:20.170
Meanwhile, your thoughtless, destructive acts...

03:20.170 --> 03:21.550
Excuse me.

03:21.550 --> 03:27.220
We can give these acts a clear and progressive meaning.

03:27.220 --> 03:31.730
I believe it's a wonderful deal for both of us.

03:31.730 --> 03:33.440
Perhaps.

03:33.440 --> 03:35.230
Let us fight together.

03:35.230 --> 03:40.570
The day when we defeat Laomoto Khan
in battle is not too far away.

03:40.570 --> 03:43.110
Incoming transmission!
Comrade Flickshot-SAN has returned!

03:43.110 --> 03:45.910
Confirmed! Revolutionary! Progress!

03:46.240 --> 03:51.460
And since you are a creature who lives for combat, like a drawn sword,

03:51.460 --> 03:55.840
we have the perfect revolutionary mission for you.

03:56.590 --> 04:00.050
DŌMO, ANSWERER-SAN.
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:00.340 --> 04:02.260
I am Flickshot.

04:04.510 --> 04:08.220
In an area kept artificially green by intense effort,

04:08.220 --> 04:11.980
a train runs down a single track.

04:12.270 --> 04:16.190
This is the two-car transport SHINKANSEN, the Galaxy.

04:12.270 --> 04:16.190
NOTE: SHINKANSEN are trains made of BULLETS.

04:16.190 --> 04:22.200
The fact that there are only two cars hints at the importance of its cargo.

04:22.200 --> 04:27.700
Its cargo is a target of the revolutionary combat organization IKKI UCHIKOWASHI.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.450
GWARGH! (x3)

04:38.380 --> 04:39.880
YEEART!

04:39.880 --> 04:41.050
Throw!

04:42.920 --> 04:45.590
Second squad, execute!

04:45.890 --> 04:46.800
Charge!

04:46.800 --> 04:47.760
Revolution!

04:47.760 --> 04:48.850
Violence!

04:50.180 --> 04:51.020
Engage!

04:51.020 --> 04:51.850
Revolution!

04:51.850 --> 04:53.060
Progress!

04:55.560 --> 04:57.150
EEYAHHHHHH!

04:57.150 --> 04:58.360
GWARGH!

05:05.700 --> 05:06.990
There he is.

05:06.990 --> 05:08.280
YEEART!

05:11.660 --> 05:15.250
DŌMO, you useless bandits.

05:15.250 --> 05:17.250
I am Prominence!

05:17.580 --> 05:19.790
DŌMO, Prominence-SAN.

05:19.790 --> 05:24.340
I am a combative agent of the progressively
revolutionary organization IKKI UCHIKOWASHI.

05:24.800 --> 05:26.800
I am Flickshot.

05:26.800 --> 05:31.220
We are aware that this degenerate transport engine

05:31.220 --> 05:34.430
is controlled by the evil SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE.

05:34.430 --> 05:38.560
Prominence, you are but a member of the SIX GATES,

05:38.560 --> 05:41.270
disguised as an agent of publicized order!

05:41.270 --> 05:43.440
You are on the list to be purged!

05:45.950 --> 05:48.450
Just try it, then!

05:48.450 --> 05:54.290
Flickshot-SAN, it's true that the SYNDICATE has heard of your petty deeds.

05:54.950 --> 06:01.250
You're a pathetic, failed NINJA anarchist,
who haunts PACHINKO parlors like a beggar!

05:54.950 --> 06:01.250
NOTE: PACHINKO is superior NINJA pinball.

06:01.250 --> 06:02.710
YEEART!

06:08.800 --> 06:12.560
This is the true nature of your weapons.

06:15.140 --> 06:17.350
Comrade Flickshot-SAN!

06:17.350 --> 06:20.230
All of our comrades who were knocked out of the train are dead!

06:20.230 --> 06:22.270
They've been burned from the inside out!

06:24.570 --> 06:27.820
I've got special KATON JITSU! You just play with your balls.

06:27.820 --> 06:31.030
Let's fight, and see who truly possesses a NINJA weapon!

06:31.450 --> 06:31.910
YEEART!

06:31.910 --> 06:33.240
UWARGHH!

06:34.490 --> 06:36.830
DŌMO, Prominence-SAN.

06:36.830 --> 06:38.710
I am NINJA Slayer.

06:44.050 --> 06:47.050
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE,
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

06:47.050 --> 06:48.760
I am Prominence.

06:48.760 --> 06:55.470
So the terrorist who fought the SYNDICATE is now just a communist dog? How stupid!

06:55.470 --> 06:57.560
It's none of your business.

06:57.560 --> 06:58.230
YEEART!

06:58.230 --> 06:59.560
UWARGHH!

06:59.560 --> 07:00.850
DEBWRAH!

07:00.850 --> 07:01.400
YEEART!

07:01.400 --> 07:03.440
UWARGHH!

07:04.360 --> 07:05.520
Behold!

07:05.520 --> 07:07.940
This is NINJA IKUSA!

07:07.940 --> 07:11.160
No matter how special your JITSU,
or how strong your NINJA body,

07:11.160 --> 07:16.410
without powerful, trained KARATE, you are useless!

07:16.410 --> 07:17.830
GWARGH!

07:17.830 --> 07:19.870
This can't be happening!

07:19.870 --> 07:22.830
Cease struggling and read your HAIKU.

07:23.170 --> 07:25.630
Withdraw! Revolution! Progress!

07:25.630 --> 07:26.710
Withdraw!

07:26.710 --> 07:28.420
I knew it.

07:28.420 --> 07:31.010
All degenerate playthings of the bourgeoisie!

07:31.010 --> 07:35.180
And SŌKAIYA is the vanguard of the looters who would make Neo-SAITAMA their own!

07:35.180 --> 07:39.640
NINJA Slayer-SAN, kill that counterrevolutionary element immediately!

07:39.640 --> 07:42.440
Forced! Deployment! Execute!

07:46.860 --> 07:47.400
Children?

07:47.400 --> 07:49.070
Mommy!

07:49.070 --> 07:50.860
I'm scared!

07:50.860 --> 07:52.950
The children of the bourgeoisie.

07:52.950 --> 07:56.530
Look at their degenerate clothing!

07:58.200 --> 07:58.910
Forced!

07:58.910 --> 07:59.660
AIYEAGGH...

07:59.660 --> 08:03.370
You are a managerial employee of a degenerate preschool, yes?

08:03.370 --> 08:05.380
Uh... AIYEAGGH...

08:05.380 --> 08:09.550
Please don't hurt the children!
I don't care what you do to me!

08:09.550 --> 08:11.130
Vice-Principal!

08:11.670 --> 08:13.510
AIYEAGGH...

08:13.510 --> 08:17.600
You capitalist pigs would dare pretend to have human feelings?

08:18.470 --> 08:19.600
AIYEAGGH...

08:19.600 --> 08:21.310
The hypocrisy! It angers me!

08:21.310 --> 08:22.810
UNIFICATION!

08:22.810 --> 08:24.400
YEEART!

08:24.400 --> 08:26.020
AIYEAGGH!

08:32.650 --> 08:35.660
Have you gone mad, NINJA Slayer-SAN?

08:36.030 --> 08:37.740
IKKI UCHIKOWASHI...

08:37.740 --> 08:40.910
Now I have seen its true nature.

08:40.910 --> 08:44.370
NINJA must be slain.

08:44.370 --> 08:47.710
You dare betray us?

08:47.710 --> 08:52.050
Don't tell me you feel sentimental revulsion toward our purge of the bourgeoisie?

08:52.050 --> 08:53.720
How foolish!

08:54.010 --> 08:56.680
Progress! Revolution! Execute!

08:57.010 --> 09:00.350
Don't underestimate me, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:00.350 --> 09:05.690
Underestimating me means underestimating the IKKI UCHIKOWASHI.

09:05.690 --> 09:08.400
Unity! Unity! Unity!

09:08.810 --> 09:10.270
CHECK YOUR... PRIVILEGE!

09:10.270 --> 09:11.610
YEEART!

09:12.360 --> 09:13.860
UWARGHH!

09:14.780 --> 09:18.740
I told you not to underestimate us,
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:20.450 --> 09:24.540
This is organized ideological combat JITSU.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.750
Bouncing balls?

09:27.040 --> 09:28.380
Give up?

09:28.380 --> 09:33.210
My PACHINKO JITSU is the manifestation of my organization's anti-bourgeoisie ideology!

09:33.210 --> 09:35.010
CHECK YOUR PRIVILEGE!

09:35.010 --> 09:36.720
YEEART!

09:37.720 --> 09:39.470
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

09:39.470 --> 09:42.010
What an omni-directional attack!

09:43.220 --> 09:45.480
Hurry! Hurry and get inside!

09:45.480 --> 09:48.190
Hurry, while they're fighting each other!

09:48.600 --> 09:52.980
They are inferior beings, who grow fat off the sacrifices of the proletariat!

09:52.980 --> 09:58.700
NINJA Slayer-SAN, your destructive activities are meaningless, and a plague upon society!

09:58.700 --> 10:03.620
Thus, on behalf of IKKI UCHIKOWASHI, I declare
you a dangerous element to be purged here,

10:03.620 --> 10:09.580
with relevant documentation to be submitted post ex facto!

10:12.290 --> 10:13.670
YEEART!

10:19.800 --> 10:20.800
ABABABABA!

10:20.800 --> 10:22.180
What?

10:22.180 --> 10:23.760
YEEART!

10:25.390 --> 10:27.480
GWARGH!

10:27.480 --> 10:29.810
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

10:38.320 --> 10:40.110
Wh-What?

10:40.110 --> 10:41.370
No! Impossible!

10:41.370 --> 10:43.410
This is a materialistic impossibility!

10:43.410 --> 10:44.990
YEEART!

10:45.290 --> 10:46.830
GWARGHK!

10:50.960 --> 10:53.880
Die, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:53.880 --> 10:54.420
YEEART!

10:54.420 --> 10:56.590
GWAAAARGH!

10:56.590 --> 10:59.050
SAYŌNARA!

11:03.560 --> 11:06.270
My fight is meaningless violence...

11:06.270 --> 11:08.020
That's what you said, yes?

11:08.020 --> 11:14.480
But the wars you advocate are nothing but a glorification of massacre!

11:14.770 --> 11:18.190
You said that sentimentality was futile, right?

11:18.190 --> 11:19.950
I disagree!

11:19.950 --> 11:24.450
Sentiment is what makes a man a man.

11:25.030 --> 11:29.040
You and I are RACCOONS from the same burrow.

11:25.030 --> 11:29.040
NOTE: RACCOONS are medium-sized mammals.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.920
We are simply murderers.

11:30.920 --> 11:35.670
And sentiment is the last thing that keeps a murderer human.

11:35.670 --> 11:38.300
The last... the last...!

11:55.730 --> 11:58.110
An interesting man, he is.

11:58.400 --> 11:59.990
"He"?

12:00.360 --> 12:04.740
Your old acquaintance, AMNESIA-SAN.

12:04.740 --> 12:06.280
Your old acquaintance.

12:06.280 --> 12:08.410
Forget about the past.

12:08.410 --> 12:11.250
He has betrayed the organization and humiliated us.

12:11.250 --> 12:14.630
NINJA Slayer must be punished.

12:15.000 --> 12:17.840
I predicted this, to an extent.

12:18.840 --> 12:22.050
Yes... To an extent.
